## 🎨 Tailwind in Next.js 15

- No `tailwind.config.js`
- Use `@theme` in `globals.css`:

```css
@theme {
  --color-primary: #E63946;
  --color-secondary: #1D3557;
}
```

- Apply with Tailwind utilities:
```html
<div class="bg-[var(--color-primary)] text-white">
```

---

## ✍️ Function, Components & Method Commenting Practice

Every function must include a block comment:
- What the function does
- Parameters with types
- Return type & purpose

```ts
/**
 * Validates user email format
 * @param email - Email string to validate
 * @returns boolean - true if valid, false if invalid
 */
export const validateEmail = (email: string): boolean => {
  const regex = /^[\w.-]+@[\w.-]+\.\w+$/;
  return regex.test(email);
};
```

